    "total_required_credits (113.0) is the sum of the required_credits of all groups. The program has a mandatory International Research Enrichment (IRE) Track plus three mutually exclusive Tracks/Options (Biomolecular Chemistry Track, Core Chemistry Track + Core Elective, and the Options: Environmental and Analytical / Materials / Pure Chemistry). The sum double-counts shared courses (e.g. CHEM 2410/3420/3555 appear in multiple tracks/options; CHEM 4689/4691 appear in multiple option electives). A realistic total is the core (pre-req 6 + required 26 + capstone 3 + MATH 3 = 38) plus a chosen Track/Option (≈8-18) plus electives (4-12) plus IRE (+3).",
